* `rowList`: the 49 preprocessors `ρ(t) = t·P(t²)`, stored as the coefficient list of `P`;
* `wtList`: the 49 positive mixture weights;
* `tagList`: the kernel of each branch — Haagerup's scalar kernel (`scalar`, with a Cauchy
